---
layout: base.njk
featured: [sealy-golden-elegance-stately, tempur-adapt-medium, tempur-proadapt-medium, tempur-ergo-smart-base]
---
{% if sale.show %}
<section class="sale" aria-label="Current sale"><div class="container"><img src="{{ sale.image }}" alt="{{ sale.alt }}" width="996" height="672" data-sale-img></div></section>
{% endif %}

<section class="hero" style="background-image:url('/assets/img/site/temp-store-dark2.jpg')">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Transform Your Home with Bed Back &amp; Blinds</h1>
    <p>Discover high quality mattresses and custom window treatments at our mom and pop shop in Dubuque, Iowa.</p>
    <div class="btn-row" style="justify-content:center">
      <a class="btn" href="/mattresses/">Shop mattresses</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="{{ site.consultation_form }}">Book a free window consultation</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><h2>Featured Brands</h2></div>
    <div class="logo-grid">
      <a href="/tempur-pedic/"><img src="/assets/img/brands/tmp.png" alt="Tempur-Pedic" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/sealy/"><img src="/assets/img/brands/sealy.png" alt="Sealy" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/graber-blinds/"><img src="/assets/img/brands/graber.jpg" alt="Graber" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/hunter-douglas/"><img src="/assets/img/brands/logo-hunter-douglas.jpg" alt="Hunter Douglas" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/alta-window-fashions/"><img src="/assets/img/brands/alta.png" alt="Alta Window Fashions" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/carole-fabrics/"><img src="/assets/img/brands/carole.png" alt="Carole Fabrics" loading="lazy"></a>
      <a href="/malouf/"><img src="/assets/img/brands/malouf.png" alt="Malouf" loading="lazy" style="max-height:34px"></a>
      <a href="/furniture/"><img src="/assets/img/brands/coaster.png" alt="Coaster Fine Furniture" loading="lazy"></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><h2>Why We Stand Out</h2></div>
    <div class="features">
      <div class="feature">
        <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M3 11V6h2v3h14V6h2v12h-2v-3H5v3H3v-7zm4-4h4v2H7z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Wide Selection of High-Quality Mattresses</h3>
        <p>At Bed Back &amp; Blinds, we offer a wide selection of high-quality mattresses to suit every individual's sleep needs. From memory foam to hybrid mattresses, our products are designed to provide ultimate comfort and support for a restful night's sleep.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4 3h16v2H4zm1 4h14v2H5zm0 4h14v2H5zm0 4h14v2H5zm6 4h2v2h-2z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Complimentary Consultations for Window Treatment Solutions</h3>
        <p>Our dedicated consultant is committed to delivering personalized consultations tailored to your needs, whether for your <a href="/window-treatments/">home or business</a>. Recognizing the uniqueness of every space, we collaborate closely with you to suggest blinds or window treatments that not only enhance privacy and light control but also elevate the aesthetic appeal of your surroundings.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M5 10V7a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h8a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5h-2v2h-2v-2H7v2H5v-2H3v-5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2zm2 0h10V7a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H8a1 1 0 0 0-1 1z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>The Latest in Furniture, Pillows, and Bedding Accessories</h3>
        <p>For all your remaining needs, we present our extensive array of pillows tailored to suit your sleep preferences, along with premium Malouf sheets and bedding and elegant <a href="/furniture/">Coaster furniture</a> to enhance your living space.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M11 3h2v2.1c1.9.4 3 1.6 3.2 3.4h-2.1c-.2-1-1-1.6-2.1-1.6-1.3 0-2.1.6-2.1 1.5 0 .8.6 1.2 2.4 1.7 2.4.6 4 1.4 4 3.6 0 1.7-1.2 2.9-3.3 3.2V19h-2v-2.1c-2.1-.4-3.4-1.7-3.5-3.6h2.1c.1 1.1 1 1.8 2.4 1.8s2.3-.6 2.3-1.6c0-.9-.7-1.3-2.5-1.8-2.3-.6-3.9-1.3-3.9-3.4 0-1.6 1.1-2.8 3-3.2z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Financing Available</h3>
        <p>Discover our range of financing options tailored to suit your needs. Get the flexibility you deserve while making your dream purchase a reality. <a href="#contact">Contact us</a> today to explore our financing solutions!</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><h2>Shop Mattresses &amp; Bases</h2><p>A few of our most popular picks. Prices are for Queen size.</p></div>
    <div class="product-grid">
      {% for p in products | bySlugs(featured) %}{% include "product-card.njk" %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="center" style="margin-top:2rem"><a class="btn" href="/mattresses/">See all mattresses and bases</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><h2>Select Products</h2><p>Check out a few of our most popular offerings</p></div>
    <div class="split highlight">
      <div class="highlight-img"><img src="/assets/img/site/black-tempur-pedic-adjustable-beds-25552132-31-600.jpg" alt="Woman relaxing on a Tempur-Pedic mattress on an adjustable base" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div><h3>Tempur-Pedic Mattresses</h3><p>Discover the epitome of comfort and support with our collection of Tempur-Pedic mattresses. Crafted with precision and innovation, each mattress offers a luxurious sleep experience like no other. Engineered to conform to your body's unique contours, Tempur-Pedic mattresses provide unparalleled pressure relief and relaxation, ensuring you wake up rejuvenated every morning. Explore our range today and elevate your sleep to new heights of comfort and indulgence.</p><a href="/tempur-pedic/">Shop Tempur-Pedic</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="split highlight">
      <div class="highlight-img"><img src="/assets/img/site/graber-drapery-02.jpg" alt="Dining room with Graber drapery and woven shades" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div><h3>Graber Window Treatments</h3><p>With a wide range of styles, colors, and textures, Graber window treatments perfectly complete your unique space. A legacy of craftsmanship and dedicated expertise ensures a customized solution that is both beautiful and functional.</p><a href="/graber-blinds/">Explore Graber</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="split highlight">
      <div class="highlight-img"><img src="/assets/img/gallery/img-1147.jpg" alt="Honeycomb shades installed by Bed Back & Blinds" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div><h3>Hunter Douglas</h3><p>We carry Hunter Douglas window fashions, including Silhouette®, Luminette®, Pirouette®, and Vignette® shadings and Architella® energy efficient honeycomb shades. Our decorator will help you choose the right style and light control for every room.</p><a href="/hunter-douglas/">Explore Hunter Douglas</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="split highlight">
      <div class="highlight-img"><img src="/assets/img/site/sealy-mattress-twin-sealy-posturepedic-memory-foam-medium-12-36644699504815.jpg" alt="Bedroom with a Sealy mattress" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div><h3>Sealy Mattresses</h3><p>When you sleep on a Sealy®, you can be confident that it’s built to last. All our mattresses are engineered to exceed industry testing standards to ensure they’ll stand the test of time. It’s next-level support and all-over comfort, backed by quality you can trust.</p><a href="/sealy/">Shop Sealy</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><h2>Gallery</h2><p>A peek into our store</p></div>
    <div class="peek">
      <img src="/assets/img/site/dsc-9065.jpg" alt="Bed Back & Blinds storefront in Wacker Plaza" loading="lazy">
      <img src="/assets/img/site/2020-04-30.jpg" alt="Tempur-Pedic display in the showroom" loading="lazy">
      <img src="/assets/img/site/2023-12-28.jpg" alt="Window treatment samples in the showroom" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <p class="center" style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/gallery/">View the full gallery</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><h2>What Our Customers Say</h2><p><span class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span> Five-star reviews on Google</p></div>
    <div class="testimonials">
      {% for r in reviews %}{% if not r.mattress or r.name == 'Jeni B.' %}<figure class="testimonial">
        <div class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div>
        <blockquote>{{ r.text }}</blockquote>
        <figcaption>{{ r.name }} <span class="review-date">· Google review, {{ r.date }}</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
      {% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="center" style="margin-top:1.75rem"><a class="btn btn-outline" href="{{ site.map }}">Read all our reviews on Google</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-soft">
  <div class="container split">
    <div><img class="rounded" src="/assets/img/site/donna-and-jim.jpg" alt="Donna and Jim, the owners of Bed Back & Blinds" loading="lazy" style="max-height:460px;width:auto;margin:0 auto"></div>
    <div><h2>Meet Donna &amp; Jim</h2><p>Bed Back &amp; Blinds, a family-owned business with over 35 years of experience, offers top-quality mattresses including Tempur-Pedic and Sealy models. We also provide a range of bedding options such as sheets, pillows, and adjustable beds. Additionally, we offer window decorating services with a variety of blinds, shades, and custom drapery solutions.</p><a href="/about-us/">More about us</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "contact.njk" %}
